---
description: Khmer full female name. The FAMILY NAME COMES FIRST, exactly as for a man, and the family name is drawn from the SHARED km.person.lastName list because Khmer family names do not inflect for gender — there is no km.person.female.lastName and its absence is the design. A Cambodian woman keeps her own family name after marriage and does not take her husband's, so a married-name variant would be wrong to generate. Two parts only: no middle name, no patronymic particle.
generator: tdc
locale: km
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="km.person.lastName"/>
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="km.person.female.firstName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.l}} ${{p.f}}</data>
